  {"id": "O5", "text": "The user's favorite framework is Svelte.", "mentioned_at": "2025-06-01", "newer_than_input_facts": true}
  {"id": "O6", "text": "Cleo lives in Lisbon.", "mentioned_at": "2025-04-01"}

Output:

